// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// [SUA MQL5SYNC-02 - THEO YEU CAU] DONG BO LAI voi AutoPositionTool_UI.mq5 BAN HIEN TAI (BO QUA cot/nhan PATTERN).
// Phan mo ta ben duoi (tu "(1) COT NHAN PIVOT" den het "NGUYEN TAC TOI UU") la LICH SU cua cac ban MQL5 cu. DINH DANG DANG DUNG:
//
//   NHAN PIVOT (tai EMA(5) cua muc Pivot dang chon, 1 dong / khung, neo TRAI, cot sat than nen lon):
//     <TF>[ <lamtron>] (<Pivotdiff>/<Pivotdiff2>)<diffpv> <SpR2>/<SpR1> <RV1MD>/<RV1OW>(<so nen>/<diffV1V2>) <TenMuc> <RSI> <RSI5>/<xu huong>
//   NHAN RV1 (tai gia RV1 that, neo TRAI; khung 1m ngay ben phai cot Pivot, khung >= 5m o cot RV1):
//     <TF> {<T>}[<W%>]<pls><IMB>{<erh>/<erhdiff> <erl>/<erldiff>}[ <SigBrk><brkD>(<streak>)]<FVG>
//   NHAN RV2 (tai gia RV2 that, neo TRAI, cot ngoai cung):
//     <TF> <MA1> /<MA2> [<RV1W%>] <RV1erh>/<..> <RV1erl>/<..> [<RV2W%>] <RV2erh>/<..> <RV2erl>/<..>
//   CUM NHAN DUOI DAY THAN NEN LON (1 label nhieu dong, neo PHAI-TREN tai day nen s=0):
//     <%bien do> / <Dmax> / <Dmin> / <Elapsed> / <het gio> / (dem " " cho du 5 hang) / brkD / TC / UPDDND / <cap khung> / RV2 trend
//   THAN NEN LON: 3 doan / nen (Low-High, Open trai, Close phai), s=0 tai nen 1m hien tai + 1, nen da dong tai giua chu ky, nhan % tai dau vach Close.
//   HH/LL/MD (khung chon), OW<khung> <so nen>, moc LAM TRON mau trang, nhan Close Simple "< <khung> SMA<period>".
//   DUONG: RV1 (magenta), RV2 (mau khung), EMA(5) cua muc Pivot dang chon, OW = LWMA(Open, n) - net dut.
//
//   Gia tri Pine KHONG tinh duoc nhu MQL5 (khong co tick/spread song, khong co lich su giay):
//     * spread = hang so i_asymSpreadPts * mintick (khong phai SYMBOL_SPREAD song);
//     * bo dem giay UpA/DnA, Up/Dn, UpB/DnB, UpC/DnC (mau nhan = rowClr theo brk, khong theo AptPivotRowColor), pvD, "| per%" cua cap khung,
//       cap H4&D1 / D1&W1 (Pine khong co khung D1/W1): KHONG co;
//     * bo dem giay brkScore / CMF / UpD-DnD / thoi diem Pivot cat OW trong nen hien tai: dung varip nen CHI dem tu luc script chay live;
//     * moi khung chi co 9 khung (1m..6h) va ~205 nen TF da dong => khung lon thieu lich su 1m thi truong hien "-" (dung quy uoc MQL5).
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// © APT_MTF_Panel — tach 4 HE COT NHAN cua AutoPositionTool_UI.mq5 sang Pine v6.
//   CHI VE NHAN, KHONG VE BAT KY DUONG NAO.
//
//   (1) COT NHAN PIVOT   — DrawWoodiePivotEma() + _rv1PivAppend cua DrawRv2RsiLabels()
//        dat tai gia EMA(5) cua MUC PIVOT DUOC CHON, mot dong moi khung. [CAP NHAT
//        THEO BAN MQL5 MOI NHAT - THEO YEU CAU, SUA CRL-CUT-UPB-01]: cap
//        <UpB>/<DnB> TRA LAI vao day (cap ngoac don gio co BA cap: UpA/DnA | Up/Dn
//        | UpB/DnB); <diffrv1>/<RV1slope> va <diffrv2>/<RV2slope> BO HAN khoi
//        chuoi hien thi (hai bien nay van duoc tinh, chi khong con noi vao nua);
//        <diffpv>/<brk%> dan LIEN NGAY sau cap ngoac don (khong con dau cach); va
//        cum "<TenMuc> <RSI>/<±dRSI>" o CUOI CHUYEN TU cum CRL o (4) sang day -
//        <TenMuc> nay la MUC PIVOT GAN BID NHAT THAT SU (best/sNearLvl, tinh doc
//        lap, KHONG phu thuoc i_pivFollowNear/pivLvlUsed dang quyet dinh vi tri Y
//        va RSI/diff o dau chuoi):
//        "<TF> <RSI> / <±dRSI>(<UpA>/<DnA> | <Up>/<Dn> | <UpB>/<DnB>)<diffpv>/<brk%><TenMuc> <RSI>/<±dRSI>"
//        [SUA PIVLBL-ORDER-01 - THEO YEU CAU] Dinh dang DANG DUNG cua nhan
//        Pivot (sau khi doi thu tu <DiffRv2> len truoc <S1onS1>):
//        "<TF> <RSI5> / <±dRSI> <diffV1V2><DiffRv2><S1onS1><S1onRV2><sigbrk><cdlS1>"
//        [CAP NHAT THEO BAN MQL5 MOI NHAT - THEO YEU CAU] Dinh dang DANG DUNG
//        cua nhan Pivot (sau khi: CAT <DiffRv2> sang nhan RV2 o (3); doi
//        <S1onS1>/<S1onRV2> tu ky hieu tam giac sang GIA TRI SO; chuyen
//        <cdlS1> len NGAY SAU <TF>, ngan cach voi cum RSI bang " |"):
//        "<TF> <cdlS1> |<RSI5> / <±dRSI> <diffV1V2> <S1onS1> <S1onRV2><sigbrk>"
//        Ben MQL5 sau <S1onRV2> con cum ngoac vuong
//        "[<UpB>/<DnB> <UpC>/<DnC> <UpA>/<DnA> <Up>/<Dn><sigbrk>]" - Pine
//        KHONG co bon cap bo dem giay do (da LOAI BO tu truoc, xem ghi chu
//        tai khoi varip dau file) nen chi giu <sigbrk> o DUNG vi tri cuoi
//        chuoi, khong bia them cap bo dem nao.
//        [SUA PIVLBL-CDLS1SEP-02 - THEO YEU CAU] Dau ngan cach giua <cdlS1>
//        va cum <RSI5> / <±dRSI> doi tu " |" sang " $". Dinh dang DANG
//        DUNG cua nhan Pivot:
//        "<TF> <cdlS1> $<RSI5> / <±dRSI> <diffV1V2> <S1onS1> <S1onRV2><sigbrk>"
//        vi du:  1h 7 / -4(1/26.03 | 48/25.16 | 12.03/0)-5.2/-16S1 53/-4
//
//   (2) COT NHAN RV1     — dat tai gia RV1 that cua tung khung. [CAP NHAT THEO
//        BAN MQL5 MOI NHAT - THEO YEU CAU] Cap <UpC>/<DnC> (dieu kien William %R,
//        xem f_wprShift/muc (4)) da CAT tu cum CRL o (4) chuyen VE DAY, noi NGAY
//        SAU <TF>, AP DUNG DONG NHAT cho CA 6 khung (ke ca khung 1m — hang 1 cua
//        cum RV1-1m ben duoi):
//          txt1 = tfn + " " + <UpC>/<DnC>
//        vi du:  1m 12.03/0   5m 3.05/48   15m 0/0   30m 0/0   1h 0/0   2h 0/0
//        RIENG khung 1m: dung muc gia RV1 that, KHONG day tuyen tinh, va co CUM 6 HANG
//        ngay duoi nhan "1m <UpC>/<DnC>" (DrawRv2RsiLabels / RV1_RSILBL_1m):
//          hang 1: "1m <UpC>/<DnC>"
//          hang 2: dien dich TSF+LAM
//          hang 3: "T+0.40 L-1.10"
//          hang 4: "<RV1up>/<RV1dn>"                 (g_rvOrd*, reset theo g_barTF = M15)
//          hang 5: "<RV2up>/<RV2dn> <time left TF>"  (FormatRemain(g_barTF)=M15)
//          hang 6: "<RV1up>/<RV1dn>"                 (g_aptRvOrd*, reset M30)
//                  + hang phu 7 ben MQL5 duoc ghep thanh hang 6b ngay duoi:
//                    "<RV2up> / <RV2dn> <time left 5M>"
// [CAP NHAT THEO BAN MQL5 MOI NHAT - THEO YEU CAU] Gia tri + dinh dang cac nhan
// duoi day doi theo DUNG ban MQL5 hien tai, CHI cho 9 khung co san (1m..6h).
// CAC BO DEM GIAY <Up>/<Dn>, <UpA>/<DnA>, <UpB>/<DnB>, <UpC>/<DnC>, <UpD>/<DnD>
// ben MQL5 KHONG port vao cac chuoi moi (Pine khong can) - phan tinh cu cua
// chung (neu co) GIU NGUYEN, chi khong noi them vao nhan moi.
//   (1) Nhan PIVOT : "<TF> <cdlS1>$ <RSI5> / <±dRSI> { <WPR1>(<V1V2>) <diffrv1> <WPR2> <diffrv2> }"
//   (2) Nhan RV1   : "<TF>" (+ " <TenNenDaoChieu><mui ten>" cho khung > 1m)
//   (3) Nhan RV2   : "<TF>"
//   (5) WPR1COL    : "<TF> {<RSI>/<±dRSI><TenMuc> <diffpv>/<diffpv2>|<V1V2>}<sigbrk><brk><SpR><L±x.xx><push> <±pct>% <thoi gian>"
//       <diffpv>/<diffpv2> = (RV1 - muc Pivot)/spread, (RV2 - muc Pivot)/spread
//       (spread = i_asymSpreadPts); <±pct>% <thoi gian> = Bid lech khoi Value
//       Area 70% (Volume Profile 20 nen TF da dong) - rong khi Bid trong VA.
//   (6) PATTERN    : "<TF>[ -] <±d>/<±ty le>" = tam vung Volume Imbalance chua
//       lap tru tam Value Area / nua do rong VA ("-" khi thieu du lieu). BO <asym>.
//   Cum RV1-1m     : brkD + "<ten mau hinh><ten nen dao chieu><mui ten>"; hang
//       T/L co 2 dau cach; BO 3 hang RVORD (hang 5/6/7); 2 hang cap khung
//       day len hang 4/5, them "<ext>%" (khong co phan "| <per>%" vi phan do
//       dem bang bo dem giay).
//   Cum duoi day than nen lon: hang 1 "<RSI S1> / <±dRSI> <V1V2>", hang 2
//       nhu MQL5 CUR1 (bo bo dem), hang 3 = ten nen dao chieu hoac "-".
// KHONG ve them duong line nao, KHONG doi input/setting da co; chi THEM mot
// nhom input nen dao chieu (sao y InpCdl* ben MQL5).
//
// ===================== NGUYEN TAC TOI UU (BAT BUOC DOC) =====================
// A. CHAY TREN CHART 1m. Ben MQL5 moi khung deu doc PERIOD_M1 (AptRv1DiffAndQ1,
//    DrawRv2RsiLabels deu CopyHigh/Low/Close/TickVolume tren M1) roi lay VWAP cua
//    nB = PeriodSeconds(tf)/60 nen M1. Vi vay tren chart 1m tinh duoc TAT CA cac
//    khung mot cach NATIVE => 0 (KHONG) call request.security, khong tre nen,
//    cap nhat theo tung tick.
// B. KHONG dung ta.ema/ta.rsi toan cuc cho 19 muc x 6 khung (= 228 series cap nhat
//    tren MOI nen). Thay bang EMA/RSI DE QUY co trang thai (var array), CHI cap nhat
//    MOT LAN tai moc doi nen TF.
// C. Offset history sau nhat = nB + 1 = 121 nen -> khong cham tran max_bars_back.
// D. Moi chuoi text chi dung o barstate.islast; nhan tao MOT lan roi set_xy/set_text.
//
// ===================== PHAM VI KHUNG =====================
// [CAP NHAT THEO YEU CAU] THEM 3 khung 3h, 4h, 6h (nB = 180/240/360) - tong
// CONG 9 khung: 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1h, 2h, 3h, 4h, 6h. Lui lich su xa nhat
// (khung 6h) can ~3600 nen 1m - da nang max_bars_back len 4500 o tren de du
// choi (van duoi tran cung 5000 cua Pine Script). Ba khung MOI co THEM cong
// tac rieng (i_show3h/i_show4h/i_show6h, xem grpI o duoi) de tat bot khi
// muon giam tai: tat mot khung se bo qua vong tinh RSI/EMA 19 muc Woodie (o
// khoi trang thai) VA vong quet mau hinh + chuoi WPR (o khoi ve) cua CHINH
// khung do - hai phan ton tai nang nhat trong toan bo script.
//
// ===================== GHI CHU VE <UpA>/<DnA> | <Up>/<Dn> | <UpB>/<DnB> | <UpC>/<DnC> =========
// Bon cap nay la BO DEM CONG DON THEO GIAY (khoi accum trong CheckAlerts() ben MQL5).
// Pine khong co lich su tick nen chung CHI dem duoc tu luc script chay live; tren
// nen lich su gia tri luon la 0. Da port dung dieu kien cong don va dung moc reset
// (khung <= 30m reset theo chinh khung, khung > 30m reset theo M30).
// [CAP NHAT THEO BAN MQL5 MOI NHAT - THEO YEU CAU] Cap <UpC>/<DnC> la MOI, dieu
// kien KHONG con lien quan Q1/diffpv nhu ban cu nua ma dua HANG TREN William %R
// cua RV2(tf)/RV1(tf) (dWPR/WPR va dWPR1/WPR1, cung cong thuc dung cho cum WPR o
// (4)): UpC cong khi (dWPR>1 HOAC WPR>=-1) VA (dWPR1>1 HOAC WPR1>=-1); DnC cong
// khi (dWPR<-1 HOAC WPR<=-99) VA (dWPR1<-1 HOAC WPR1<=-99); thieu du lieu WPR/WPR1
// -> khong cong ben nao (xem f_wprShift, tra na se lam ca hai phep so sanh > va <
// deu false, dung y het quy tac "khong tinh duoc thi khong cong" cua ba cap kia).
// =============================================================================

//@version=6
// [CAP NHAT THEO YEU CAU] THEM 3 khung 3h/4h/6h (xem APT_TFN/aptNb/aptTfName
// o duoi). Khung xa nhat trong so 3 khung MOI (6h, nB=360) can lui toi ~3600
// nen 1m (vuot qua 3000 cu) - nang max_bars_back len 4500 de du choi (van
// nam duoi tran cung 5000 cua chinh Pine Script, con du ~1400 nen). KHONG
// doi bat ky tham so nao khac cua indicator().
indicator("APT MTF Panel (Pivot/RV1/RV2/CRL)", shorttitle="APT-MTF", overlay=true, max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=500, max_bars_back=4500)

//══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// HANG SO SAO CHEP TU AutoPositionTool_UI.mq5
//══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// [CAP NHAT THEO YEU CAU] THEM 3 khung 3h/4h/6h vao CUOI danh sach (xem
// aptNb/aptTfName o duoi) - 6 khung cu GIU NGUYEN thu tu/gia tri, KHONG doi.
const int APT_TFN     = 9     // so khung: 1m 5m 15m 30m 1h 2h 3h 4h 6h
const int APT_LVN     = 19    // PP + R1..R9 + S1..S9
const int APT_EMA_P   = 5     // InpWoodiePivotEmaPeriod / InpEmaPeriod
const int APT_RSI_P   = 5     // WOODIE_RSI_PERIOD
// [SUA MQL5SYNC-02 - THEO YEU CAU] 12 -> 100: kenh W%/erh/erl cua chuoi RV1/RV2 va William %R khong kep (Wpr8*) ben MQL5 can
// ~5*P+5 mau RV (P = so nen kenh brkD) - 12 mau khong du. Khung lon thieu lich su 1m thi cac truong tu hien "-" (dung quy uoc MQL5).
const int APT_SAMP_N  = 100   // so mau RV1 luu lai (>= APT_Q_BARS)
const int APT_TP_NB   = 5     // AptTickPressureCalc: nB toi thieu khi scanTF/chart = 1m
const int APT_BAR_NB  = 15    // InpBarChartTF mac dinh = PERIOD_M15 (g_barTF)
// M1_ELP_LBL_DIF1_DIGITS = 1 -> diffrv1 / RV1slope / rv2diff in 1 chu so thap phan
// InpTFStatBrkDigits     = 0 -> brk% in 0 chu so thap phan

//══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// INPUTS
//══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
grpB = "=== BAT / TAT TUNG HE COT NHAN ==="
i_showPiv = input.bool(true, "Cot nhan PIVOT (day du)", group=grpB)
i_showRv1 = input.bool(true, "Cot nhan RV1", group=grpB)
i_showRv2 = input.bool(true, "Cot nhan RV2", group=grpB)
i_showCrl = input.bool(true, "Cum nhan tren dinh nen (CRL)", group=grpB)

// [CAP NHAT THEO YEU CAU] Cong tac RIENG cho 3 khung MOI (3h/4h/6h) de tat
// bot khi muon giam tai (tat mot khung se bo qua vong tinh RSI/EMA 19 muc
// Woodie cua khung do o khoi trang thai, VA bo qua vong quet mau hinh +
// chuoi WPR cua khung do o khoi ve - hai phan ton tai nang nhat script).
// 6 khung cu (1m..2h) KHONG co cong tac rieng, luon chay nhu truoc, KHONG
// doi hanh vi/setting nao cua chung.
grpI = "=== BAT / TAT KHUNG MOI (3h/4h/6h) - GIAM TAI ==="
i_show3h = input.bool(true, "Bat khung 3h", group=grpI)
i_show4h = input.bool(true, "Bat khung 4h", group=grpI)
i_show6h = input.bool(true, "Bat khung 6h", group=grpI)

grpL = "=== MUC PIVOT CUA COT NHAN PIVOT ==="
i_pivLvl = input.string("PP", "Muc Pivot co dinh (g_pivotLevelIdx, dung khi tat o duoi)", options=["PP", "R1", "R2", "R3", "R4", "R5", "R6", "R7", "R8", "R9", "S1", "S2", "S3", "S4", "S5", "S6", "S7", "S8", "S9"], group=grpL)
// [CAP NHAT THEO BAN MQL5 MOI NHAT - THEO YEU CAU] Input MOI, tuong duong bang
// nut "TenMuc"/"BangUI" ben MQL5 (g_pivotFollowDisplayedLvl) - Pine khong co nut
// bam tren chart nen dung MOT input.bool trong bang setting thay the, gan y het
// muc dich: bat (mac dinh true, KHOP mac dinh cua MQL5) -> nhan/duong Pivot cua
// TUNG khung tu chon muc GAN BID NHAT cua CHINH no (dung CHUNG chi so "best" ma
// cum CRL o (4) dang dung cho <TenMuc>, xem khoi tinh best/sNearLvl o tren) thay
// vi luon dung CHUNG mot muc co dinh i_pivLvl; tat -> quay lai dinh dang CU (muc
// co dinh cho ca 6 khung, dung i_pivLvl). Xem khoi gan pivLvlUsed/gp trong muc
// (1) COT NHAN PIVOT ben duoi.
i_pivFollowNear = input.bool(false, "Nhan/duong Pivot ve theo TenMuc dang hien o CRL (dong, mac dinh) thay vi muc co dinh", group=grpL)

grpA = "=== MOC CHIA NEN KHUNG LON ==="
i_anchorMin = input.int(0, "Lech moc chia khung so voi 00:00 UTC (phut)", minval=-720, maxval=720, group=grpA, tooltip="MT5 chia nen theo gio server (thuong UTC+2/+3). Dat 120 hoac 180 de moc doi nen trung voi MT5.")

grpP = "=== VI TRI COT NHAN (so nen 1m, am = ve ben trai) ==="
// [SUA MQL5SYNC-02] Mac dinh khop MQL5: cot Pivot sat vach Close than nen lon (BARCUR_FUTURE_BARS=1 + InpBarTickChartBars=3 -> ~4 nen 1m),
// cot RV1(>=5m) = InpRv1LeftM1FutureBars = 30, cot RV2 = InpRv1Rv2LeftM1BarIdx = 44; nhan RV1 khung 1m = i_gapRv1m1 (ben phai cot Pivot).
i_gapPiv = input.int(4,   "Cot PIVOT cach nen hien tai (nen 1m)", group=grpP)
i_gapRv1 = input.int(30,  "Cot RV1 (>=5m) cach nen hien tai (InpRv1LeftM1FutureBars)", group=grpP)
i_gapRv2 = input.int(44, "Cot RV2 cach nen hien tai (InpRv1Rv2LeftM1BarIdx)", group=grpP)
i_gapCrl = input.int(0,   "Cum CRL cach nen hien tai", group=grpP)
i_crlStep = input.float(0.16, "Buoc gian dong cua cum CRL (x ATR14)", minval=0.02, step=0.02, group=grpP)
// [SUA MQL5SYNC-02] Mac dinh size.normal -> size.small (MQL5: font 8 cho nhan Pivot / RV1 / RV2 / cum than nen lon).
i_fontSize = input.string(size.small, "Co chu", options=[size.tiny, size.small, size.normal, size.large], group=grpP)
i_gapRv1m1 = input.int(12, "Nhan RV1 khung 1m cach nen hien tai (nen 1m) - MQL5: ngay ben phai chu cot Pivot", group=grpP)

grpC = "=== MAU DU PHONG (khi thang mau brk khong bat) ==="
i_colUp = input.color(#FFC400, "Mau du phong chieu TANG", group=grpC)
i_colDn = input.color(#F0F0F0, "Mau du phong chieu GIAM", group=grpC)

// [CAP NHAT THEO BAN MQL5 MOI NHAT - THEO YEU CAU] Input MOI, tuong duong
// InpBrkDBars cua [SUA BRKD-02] ben AutoPositionTool_UI.mq5: so nen cua KENH
// dung lam mau so cho brkD. Kenh lay tu nen TF DA DONG gan nhat lui ve N nen,
// KHONG gom nen TF dang chay - nho vay brkD van co the > 100 (pha dinh kenh)
// hoac < 0 (thung day kenh) va thang mau f_brkCode() GIU NGUYEN y nghia,
// khong phai hieu chinh mot nguong nao.
// KHAC BIET DUY NHAT so voi MQL5: ben do kep [2, 500], ben nay kep [2, 60]
// vi lich su H/L cua tung khung phai luu san trong matrix (APT_BRKD_HIST) -
// Pine khong co iHighest/iLowest doc thang lich su khung khac nhu MT5.
grpBD = "=== KENH brkD (cot WPR1COL + brkScore) ==="
// [SUA MQL5SYNC-02] mac dinh 5 -> 10 (InpBrkDBars = 10 ben MQL5).
i_brkDBars = input.int(10, "So nen cua kenh brkD (nut B<n>, MQL5 mac dinh 10)", minval=2, maxval=60, group=grpBD)
// [CAP NHAT THEO BAN MQL5 MOI NHAT - THEO YEU CAU] Input MOI, tuong duong
// InpBrkScoreTfCount cua [SUA BRKSCORE-TFCOUNT-01] ben AutoPositionTool_UI.mq5:
// so khung THAM GIA tinh brkScore (f_brkScore(), xem than ham o duoi trong
// file) - truoc day hang cung "for k = 0 to 4" (LUON DU 5 khung). Tu nay doc
// n khung DAU TIEN trong aptNb/g_tfList-tuong-duong (k = 0..n-1), tuc THEO
// DUNG THU TU 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1h - KHONG doi thu tu/gia tri mang goc. KEP
// trong [1, 5] ngay trong f_brkScore() (5 = so khung co trong so w_k = k+1
// ma cong thuc dang dinh nghia, KHONG mo rong qua khung thu 6 tro di) nen
// dat sai gia tri o day cung khong lam hong ham. Mac dinh HA tu 5 (ca 5
// khung 1m..1h) XUONG 2 (CHI 1m + 5m) THEO YEU CAU - CHI doi SO KHUNG tham
// gia, cong thuc brkScore = SUM(w_k * sign(brkD_k-50)) / SUM(w_k) va trong
// so w_k = k+1 GIU NGUYEN 100%, khong doi mot phep tinh nao khac.
// [SUA MQL5SYNC-02] mac dinh 2 -> 3 (RV2_ORDN_DEFAULT = 3 ben MQL5: 1m, 5m, 15m).
i_brkScoreTfCount = input.int(3, "brkScore: so khung tham gia (1..5, theo thu tu 1m/5m/15m/30m/1h)", minval=1, maxval=5, group=grpBD)

grpD = "=== DUONG RV1 / RV2 / S1 KHUNG 1m (BO SUNG) ==="
i_showLineRv1 = input.bool(true, "Ve duong RV1 (1m)", group=grpD)
